    "updated_at": "2020-07-09T23:00:04Z",
    "body": "This is very interesting. For me, [gitstatus](https://github.com/romkatv/gitstatus) (based on libgit2) has been _orders_ of magnitude faster than the default gitprompt shipping in git's contrib folder (which calls `git`, and is painfully slow, so slow I had to try to find an alternative), so I'm not sure what is happening here.\r\n\r\nDoes Starship maintain a daemon in the background, like gitstatus?",
