    "body": "> Has using [the gitstatus libgit2 fork](https://github.com/romkatv/libgit2) (I assume that's it) instead of upstream libgit2 ever been attempted?\r\n\r\nNot yet, no. I haven't delved too much into the [git2-rs](https://github.com/rust-lang/git2-rs) codebase, but I would worry that  changes to libgit2  break compatibility with the git2-rs bindings. It sounds like it'd be well worth trying though. 😄",
