    "updated_at": "2020-10-06T06:33:10Z",
    "body": "Hi folks,\r\nI switched to Starship recently and noticed some performance issues as well for git. Have you considered using [romkatv's custom gitstatus](https://github.com/romkatv/gitstatus)? It was built explicitly to produce the limited output that prompts needed with minimal latency.\r\n\r\nEDIT: Given it's a non-Rust binary, this might be a better fit as an alternate git module that interested users can configure. This avoids the complexity of bundling this in all custom releases to maintain cross-platform compatibility. Any thoughts?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
